              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Siit 19:2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.18.19"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Age 18:19",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PRO.13.22"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Awa 13:22",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Aso do sirikikorakis akusipesur otelepaikec, karaida amanyanakin ikusitelepai akecepesur, siriikotononos ainapakinikee karaida asulianyikec ikar kere: tetere igogonooros, inyamete ajokis naka akwap, inyeiniata ikusidwe araun airumet ikar kere.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.9.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 9:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ido kedautu nun adolokin sio kanuka aswamisiokosi nueroko, kanuka agwaun akiro nuepolok, naarai ijo Ekosideke ibu kitican sio kwabo mere kwape ibusakinitor numam adolitekosi, koinak sio aatoŋot kwape na. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.9.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.9.13"
            ]
          }
        },
